# Find an Untapped Channel

## Objective
Identify marketing channels FlyRank can test beyond its current acquisition strategy.

## Ranked Opportunities

### 1. Reddit Communities
- Audience: SEO professionals, AI founders, SaaS marketers
- Effort: Medium
- Cost: Low
- Test:
  - Answer community questions
  - Share case studies
  - Measure referral traffic

### 2. Indie Hackers
- Audience: Startup founders
- Effort: Medium
- Cost: Free
- Test:
  - Weekly educational posts
  - Share customer stories

### 3. Product Hunt Discussions
- Audience: Product builders
- Effort: Low
- Cost: Free
- Test:
  - Join discussions
  - Share AI growth insights

### 4. Quora
- Audience: People searching SEO and AI questions
- Effort: Medium
- Cost: Free
- Test:
  - Publish high-quality answers
  - Track website clicks

### 5. AI Newsletters & Podcasts
- Audience: AI professionals and founders
- Effort: High
- Cost: Medium
- Test:
  - Newsletter sponsorship
  - Founder interviews

## Recommendation

Start with Reddit because it offers high audience relevance, low cost, and measurable results.
